1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:02,550
Every time I have money, I crash the car,

2
00:00:02,570 --> 00:00:06,304
every time I have money, something in my house breaks.

3
00:00:06,324 --> 00:00:07,387
Why? Because

4
00:00:07,407 --> 00:00:10,181
our ancestors also carry some of these programs,

5
00:00:10,201 --> 00:00:12,876
which we bring in the epigenetic field.

6
00:00:12,896 --> 00:00:14,848
So, back then: money is the root of

7
00:00:14,868 --> 00:00:17,340
