8
00:00:17,500 --> 00:00:20,200
Or, if I have a lot of money, I will drift away from God.

9
00:00:20,220 --> 00:00:22,730
And this person ends up carrying that belief,

10
00:00:22,750 --> 00:00:24,904
no matter how hard she fights, no matter how

11
00:00:24,924 --> 00:00:27,079
